#X text 300 400 Chaos runs on the automater's shared throttle tick instead of a [metro 30] and a [line 0 10] of its own. Pd keeps pending clocks in one sorted list \, so hundreds of per-instance clocks made every reschedule walk hundreds of entries. The random target is still drawn every 30 ms \, and the expr reproduces [line]'s linear ramp at a 10 ms grain: right outlet = still ramping \, left = value.;
