#X text 108 522 Base value \, chaos \, LFO and external mod are summed and clipped exactly as the old serial CHAOS -> LFO -> EXT_MOD chain did. While neither chaos nor the LFO is running a change goes straight out \, as before. While one is \, changes are only stored \, and each throttle tick steps chaos \, then the LFO \, then sends the mix once - so a parameter with playback + chaos + LFO sends <= 100 values/s rather than ~300 \, and the throttle receive is shut when nothing modulates.;
